WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.531 --> 00:00:02.250
Hey! Conan 360 Live.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.031
I am John Kourounis of Warner Brothers'

00:00:04.031 --> 00:00:05.324
Studio Tour Hollywood.

00:00:05.324 --> 00:00:06.671
I'm currently standing
in the Warner Brothers'

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:09.726
archive museum and I
cannot wait to show you

00:00:09.726 --> 00:00:12.815
around some of my
absolute favorite things.

00:00:12.815 --> 00:00:14.188
Let's check it out.

00:00:14.188 --> 00:00:16.591
Here we have Wonder Woman.

00:00:16.591 --> 00:00:18.492
Now this is as you would've seen her

00:00:18.492 --> 00:00:21.164
in Batman Vs. Superman, where
we were really introduced

00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:23.137
to Gal Gadot's performance
of Wonder Woman.

00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:25.359
And we have her original costume here.

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.786
Absolutely love it.

00:00:26.786 --> 00:00:27.967
If you guys check it out,

00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:30.202
they were designed by Michael Wilkinson,

00:00:30.202 --> 00:00:31.729
directed by Zack Snyder,

00:00:31.729 --> 00:00:33.041
what a wonderful, wonderful movie.

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:35.066
Great character, great performance.

00:00:35.066 --> 00:00:36.391
Now right next to that, just in case,

00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:39.423
you know, we ever have
another super attack,

00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:41.896
we have the kryptonite staff

00:00:41.896 --> 00:00:44.735
that Batman also uses
in Batman Vs. Superman.

00:00:44.735 --> 00:00:47.398
Speaking of Batman, take a look.

00:00:47.398 --> 00:00:49.541
Now he's got a few different
costumes that we actually see

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:50.672
in Batman Vs. Superman,

00:00:50.672 --> 00:00:52.873
and this is one of my
personal favorite ones.

00:00:52.873 --> 00:00:55.224
You can see that it's really
got some wear and tear

00:00:55.224 --> 00:00:56.269
because he is Batman,

00:00:56.269 --> 00:00:59.077
he's been Batman for a really long time.

00:00:59.077 --> 00:01:00.855
How cool are these things?

00:01:00.855 --> 00:01:02.514
Now we're back in the
Suicide Squad section

00:01:02.514 --> 00:01:04.040
of our archive, and you can see

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.655
some of the Joker's henchmen.

00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:07.408
I actually tried to borrow
this for Valentine's Day.

00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:09.237
Not only did the studio not let me do it,

00:01:09.237 --> 00:01:12.063
but my girlfriend was
like, absolutely not.

00:01:12.063 --> 00:01:13.955
We have another one of
the Joker's henchmen.

00:01:13.955 --> 00:01:16.829
He's got an eye for crime.

00:01:16.829 --> 00:01:18.107
Moving right along.

00:01:18.107 --> 00:01:20.366
You can see the Joker himself, right here.

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:23.053
Played by Jared Leto,
and his Joker was really

00:01:23.053 --> 00:01:25.158
kind of inspired by like
the rich kids of Instagram.

00:01:25.158 --> 00:01:26.855
He's a very indulgent Joker,

00:01:26.855 --> 00:01:29.014
and believe it or not,
not many people know this,

00:01:29.014 --> 00:01:32.085
this is the exact tuxedo Jared Leto

00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:34.443
also wore to the Academy Awards.

00:01:34.443 --> 00:01:35.910
All authentic costumes and props.

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.702
All the way on the wall over here,

00:01:37.702 --> 00:01:39.626
we have part of the Wayne mausoleum,

00:01:39.626 --> 00:01:42.744
and also little Wayne, right here.

00:01:42.744 --> 00:01:44.165
We also have one of my favorite things,

00:01:44.165 --> 00:01:46.638
all original, first
edition, number one comics

00:01:46.638 --> 00:01:48.181
straight out of the DC comic vault,

00:01:48.181 --> 00:01:49.658
never been on display before.

00:01:49.658 --> 00:01:50.718
We have Green Lantern,

00:01:50.718 --> 00:01:51.596
we have Flash,

00:01:51.596 --> 00:01:53.251
the very first Batman comic.

00:01:53.251 --> 00:01:54.133
We have Superman,

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:55.213
we have Wonder Woman,

00:01:55.213 --> 00:01:56.589
we have Cyborg.

00:01:56.589 --> 00:01:58.069
C'mon guys, Cyborg. Get excited.

00:01:58.069 --> 00:01:59.746
New Teen Titans, that's what that is.

00:01:59.746 --> 00:02:01.389
We also have Aquaman,

00:02:01.389 --> 00:02:03.804
we have the Lois, Clark, and Perry suits

00:02:03.804 --> 00:02:05.328
from the Daily Planet.

00:02:05.328 --> 00:02:07.558
And, as you can clearly see,

00:02:07.558 --> 00:02:08.975
Superman himself.

00:02:09.927 --> 00:02:11.484
3D printed suit, you have to put

00:02:11.484 --> 00:02:13.375
this thing on like a wetsuit.

00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:14.787
He's also got the
language of Krypton across

00:02:14.787 --> 00:02:16.720
the S and on his shoulders.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.942
And little known fact, they
actually got the molding

00:02:19.942 --> 00:02:22.908
from tour guides for the suit right here.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:24.098
That's not true. At all.

00:02:24.098 --> 00:02:26.206
Listen, that's gonna do
it for me, John Kourounis.

00:02:26.206 --> 00:02:27.640
Come see all of these things for yourself

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.392
at Warner Brothers' Studio Tour Hollywood,

00:02:29.392 --> 00:02:30.866
because these are just a few

00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:33.630
of the amazing things on this tour.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.364
So book your tickets
today, wbstudiotour.com,

00:02:36.364 --> 00:02:38.447
and we will see you soon.

